msgstr "Für ein BUY erforderlicher Abschlag auf den fairen Wert."

#. Context: Settings › slider label
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:618
msgid "BUY score threshold"
msgstr "BUY-Score-Schwelle"

#. Context: Settings › slider description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:620
msgid "Composite score required for a BUY signal."
msgstr "Für ein BUY-Signal erforderlicher Gesamtscore."

#. Context: Settings › row title
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:625
msgid "Screening style"
msgstr "Screening-Stil"

#. Context: Settings › Screening style description. Style names must match the
#. options below.
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:626
msgid ""
"Which signals lead the composite score — Value tilts to margin of safety & "
"quality, Growth to momentum, Income to dividends."
msgstr ""
"Welche Signale den Gesamtscore prägen – Value setzt auf Sicherheitsmarge & "
"Qualität, Wachstum auf Momentum, Einkommen auf Dividenden."

#. Context: Settings › toggle title
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:630
msgid "Benchmark — Euro Stoxx 50"
msgstr "Benchmark – Euro Stoxx 50"

#. Context: Settings › benchmark toggle description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:631
msgid "Overlay on the portfolio value chart."
msgstr "Im Portfoliowert-Diagramm einblenden."

#. Context: Settings › toggle title
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:633
msgid "Include US-listed names"
msgstr "US-gelistete Titel einbeziehen"

#. Context: Settings › toggle description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:634
msgid "Extend the screener beyond European exchanges."
msgstr "Den Screener über europäische Börsen hinaus erweitern."

#. Context: Settings › section heading
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:670
msgid "Target allocation"
msgstr "Zielallokation"

#. Context: Settings › Target allocation description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:671
msgid ""
"Your personal reference weights. When any are set, the Risk page's rebalancing "
"signals switch from absolute thresholds to drift-vs-target."
msgstr ""
"Deine persönlichen Referenzgewichte. Sobald eines gesetzt ist, wechseln die "
"Rebalancing-Signale der Risiko-Seite von absoluten Schwellen zur Abweichung vom "
"Ziel."

#. Context: Settings › Target allocation › row title and field label
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:676 uvalu/pages_/settings.py:679
msgid "Sector targets"
msgstr "Sektorziele"

#. Context: Settings › Sector targets description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:677
#, no-python-format
msgid "Blank = no sector targets; the 30% guideline applies instead."
msgstr "Leer = keine Sektorziele; dann gilt die 30-%-Richtlinie."

#. Context: Settings › Sector targets › example text inside the empty box.
#. Sector names in the example should be the translated ones.
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:681
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"One per line — sector and target %:\n"
"Technology 25\n"
"Healthcare 15"
msgstr ""
"Eine pro Zeile – Sektor und Ziel in %:\n"
"Technologie 25\n"
"Gesundheitswesen 15"

#. Context: Settings › Target allocation › row title and field label
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:684 uvalu/pages_/settings.py:687
msgid "Per-name targets"
msgstr "Ziele je Titel"

#. Context: Settings › Per-name targets description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:685
#, no-python-format
msgid "Blank = no per-name targets; only the 20% hard cap applies."
msgstr "Leer = keine Ziele je Titel; nur die harte Obergrenze von 20 % gilt."

#. Context: Settings › Per-name targets › example text inside the empty box.
#. Use the local decimal separator in 7.5.
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:689
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"One per line — ticker and target %:\n"
"AAA.BR 10\n"
"BBB.PA 7.5"
msgstr ""
"Eine pro Zeile – Ticker und Ziel in %:\n"
"AAA.BR 10\n"
"BBB.PA 7,5"

#. Context: Settings › Target allocation › row title and field label
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:693 uvalu/pages_/settings.py:696
msgid "Concentration ceiling (HHI)"
msgstr "Konzentrationsobergrenze (HHI)"

#. Context: Settings › HHI description. Use the local decimal separator.
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:694
msgid ""
"Flag when portfolio HHI exceeds this. 0 = use the default 0.10 / 0.18 bands."
msgstr ""
"Markieren, wenn der HHI des Portfolios diesen Wert übersteigt. 0 = "
"Standardbänder 0,10 / 0,18."

#. Context: Settings › Target allocation › save button
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:701
msgid "Save target allocation"
msgstr "Zielallokation speichern"

#. Context: Settings › toast after saving
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:713
msgid "Target allocation saved."
msgstr "Zielallokation gespeichert."

#. Context: Settings › section heading
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:718
msgid "Data"
msgstr "Daten"

#. Context: Settings › Data › row title
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:731
msgid "Price refresh interval"
msgstr "Kursaktualisierungsintervall"

#. Context: Settings › Data › refresh interval description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:732
msgid "How often quotes update during market hours."
msgstr "Wie oft die Kurse während der Handelszeiten aktualisiert werden."

#. Context: Settings › Data › toggle title
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:750
msgid "Ex-dividend alerts"
msgstr "Ex-Tag-Hinweise"

#. Context: Settings › Data › toggle description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:751
msgid "Flag holdings going ex-dividend within 7 days on the Dashboard."
msgstr "Positionen mit Ex-Tag innerhalb von 7 Tagen im Dashboard markieren."

#. Context: Settings › Data › slider label under Ex-dividend alerts
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:761
msgid "Only above this position weight"
msgstr "Nur ab diesem Positionsgewicht"

#. Context: Settings › Data › slider value when set to 0%
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:762
msgid "any size"
msgstr "jede Größe"

#. Context: Settings › Data › slider description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:763
#, no-python-format
msgid "0% flags every held ex-date; raise it to only badge your larger positions."
msgstr ""
"Bei 0 % wird jeder Ex-Tag markiert; erhöhe den Wert, um nur größere Positionen "
"zu kennzeichnen."

#. Context: Settings › Data › toggle title
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:774
msgid "Dividend cut / suspension alerts"
msgstr "Hinweise bei Dividendenkürzung / -aussetzung"

#. Context: Settings › Data › toggle description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:775
msgid ""
"Flag a holding on the Dashboard when its dividend was just cut or suspended."
msgstr ""
"Eine Position im Dashboard markieren, wenn ihre Dividende gerade gekürzt oder "
"ausgesetzt wurde."

#. Context: Settings › Data › toggle title
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:783
msgid "Dividend increase alerts"
msgstr "Hinweise bei Dividendenerhöhung"

#. Context: Settings › Data › toggle description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:784
msgid "Flag a holding on the Dashboard when its dividend was just raised."
msgstr ""
"Eine Position im Dashboard markieren, wenn ihre Dividende gerade erhöht wurde."

#. Context: Settings › section heading
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:793
msgid "Dividend withholding"
msgstr "Quellensteuer auf Dividenden"

#. Context: Settings › Dividend withholding description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:794
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Default withholding tax % applied when you record a dividend on each exchange — "
"always editable per record. Depends on your own tax residency and treaty, which "
"this app has no way to know, so every rate starts at 0% until you set it."
msgstr ""
"Standard-Quellensteuersatz, der beim Erfassen einer Dividende je Börse "
"angewendet wird – pro Eintrag jederzeit änderbar. Er hängt von deinem "
"Steuerwohnsitz und dem Doppelbesteuerungsabkommen ab, die die App nicht kennen "
"kann; daher beginnt jeder Satz bei 0 %, bis du ihn festlegst."

#. Context: Settings › section heading
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:814
msgid "Import & export"
msgstr "Import & Export"

#. Context: Settings › Import portfolio description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:821
msgid ""
"Upload an Excel file to import positions, sold history and dividends. This "
"replaces all existing portfolio data for this account."
msgstr ""
"Lade eine Excel-Datei hoch, um Positionen, Verkaufshistorie und Dividenden zu "
"importieren. Dies ersetzt alle bestehenden Portfoliodaten dieses Kontos."

#. Context: Settings › file upload label
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:822
msgid "Choose your portfolio .xlsx file"
msgstr "Wähle deine Portfolio-Datei (.xlsx)"

#. Context: Settings › loading message during import
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:825
msgid "Parsing Excel…"
msgstr "Excel wird gelesen …"

#. Context: Settings › import error. Keep the exchange codes as they are.
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:829
msgid ""
"No open EBR:/AMS:/EPA:/BIT:/ETR:/SWX: positions found. Check that your file "
"matches the expected format."
msgstr ""
"Keine offenen EBR:/AMS:/EPA:/BIT:/ETR:/SWX:-Positionen gefunden. Prüfe, ob deine "
"Datei dem erwarteten Format entspricht."

#. Context: Settings › success message after import
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:838
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Imported {open} open, {sold} sold, {dividends} dividend records."
msgstr "Importiert: {open} offen, {sold} verkauft, {dividends} Dividendeneinträge."

#. Context: Settings › import error; {error} is a technical message (stays
#. English)
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:842
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Could not parse file: {error}"
msgstr "Datei konnte nicht gelesen werden: {error}"

#. Context: Settings › row title
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:847
msgid "Excel export"
msgstr "Excel-Export"

#. Context: Settings › Excel export description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:848
msgid ""
"Human-readable workbook with positions, dividends, sold history and watchlist. "
"Useful for inspection or migration."
msgstr ""
"Gut lesbare Arbeitsmappe mit Positionen, Dividenden, Verkaufshistorie und "
"Watchlist. Praktisch zur Kontrolle oder Migration."

#. Context: Settings › download button (keep the file name)
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:852
msgid "Download backup.xlsx"
msgstr "backup.xlsx herunterladen"

#. Context: Settings › export notice
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:858
msgid ""
"Your portfolio is empty. Add positions in the Portfolio section first, then come "
"back to export."
msgstr ""
"Dein Portfolio ist leer. Füge zuerst Positionen unter Portfolio hinzu und "
"exportiere dann."

#. Context: Settings › export error; {error} is technical (stays English)
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:860
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Could not create Excel: {error}"
msgstr "Excel-Datei konnte nicht erstellt werden: {error}"

#. Context: Watchlist › caption under the title
#: uvalu/pages_/watchlist.py:66
msgid ""
"Track tickers you don't hold yet. Add from the screener with the star, or type a "
"symbol directly below."
msgstr ""
"Verfolge Ticker, die du noch nicht besitzt. Füge sie im Screener mit dem Stern "
"hinzu oder gib unten direkt ein Symbol ein."

#. Context: Watchlist › submit button
#: uvalu/pages_/watchlist.py:98
msgid "Add ticker"
msgstr "Ticker hinzufügen"

#. Context: Watchlist › field label
#: uvalu/pages_/watchlist.py:107 uvalu/pages_/watchlist.py:109
msgid "Company name (optional)"
msgstr "Firmenname (optional)"

#. Context: Watchlist › empty state
#: uvalu/pages_/watchlist.py:143
msgid "Your watchlist is empty. Star a ticker in the screener or add one above."
msgstr ""
"Deine Watchlist ist leer. Markiere einen Ticker im Screener mit einem Stern oder "
"füge oben einen hinzu."

#. Context: Watchlist › loading caption
#: uvalu/pages_/watchlist.py:154
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Fetching data for your {count} watchlisted ticker… {done}/{total} companies "
"scored."
msgid_plural ""
"Fetching data for your {count} watchlisted tickers… {done}/{total} companies "
"scored."
msgstr[0] ""
"Daten für deinen {count} Watchlist-Ticker werden abgerufen … {done}/{total} "
"Unternehmen bewertet."
msgstr[1] ""
"Daten für deine {count} Watchlist-Ticker werden abgerufen … {done}/{total} "
"Unternehmen bewertet."

#. Context: Watchlist › note when data isn't loaded yet
#: uvalu/pages_/watchlist.py:158
msgid ""
"No screener data yet for your watchlisted ticker — it will appear after the next "
"screener refresh."
msgid_plural ""
"No screener data yet for your watchlisted tickers — they'll appear after the "
"next screener refresh."
msgstr[0] ""
"Noch keine Screener-Daten für deinen Watchlist-Ticker – sie erscheinen nach der "
"nächsten Screener-Aktualisierung."
msgstr[1] ""
"Noch keine Screener-Daten für deine Watchlist-Ticker – sie erscheinen nach der "
"nächsten Screener-Aktualisierung."

